* impedance of phase1 of left example
.meas TRAN Vab MAX V(a) FROM 500m TO 520m
.meas TRAN Iab MAX Ix(U25:IN1) FROM 500m TO 520m
.meas TRAN Zab PARAM Vab/Iab
* impedance of phase2 of left example
.meas TRAN Vde MAX V(d) FROM 500m TO 520m
.meas TRAN Ide MAX Ix(U25:IN2) FROM 500m TO 520m
.meas TRAN Zde PARAM Vde/Ide
* impedance of phase3 of left example
.meas TRAN Vgh MAX V(g) FROM 500m TO 520m
* since Igh is not symmetric to the y-axis peak to peak:
.meas TRAN Igh PP Ix(U25:IN3) FROM 500m TO 520m
.meas TRAN Zgh PARAM Vgh/(Igh/2)
